			I('Remember', '· A は B です: A is B. です never changes for I, you or they.<br>· Add か for a question. Use じゃありません for "is not".<br>· の links owner to thing, も means "too" and replaces は.<br>Memory trick: think of は as a little flag you plant on the topic: "as for this one...". Then say your news and close with です.')
